      <div class="account-footnote"><span data-icon="shield"></span><p>You're viewing a sample account. Orders, spending and profile changes here do not affect the live store.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section id="section-orders" class="account-section" hidden><article class="account-panel empty-state"><span class="empty-icon" data-icon="box"></span><h2>Your first coffee order starts a story.</h2><p>No orders in this sample account. Your Shopify order history and reorder options will appear here after the approved integration.</p><span class="connection-label">Order tracking: waiting for Shiprocket</span><p class="small-copy">Processing, shipping and courier tracking are not connected in this preview.</p></article></section>
